{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2023-03-02 09:38:00', 'title': 'TOLEDO EDISON BEGINS INSTALLATION OF 1,000 LED STREETLIGHTS IN PERRYSBURG', 'text': "SWITCH TO LEDS ESTIMATED TO SAVE CITY $30,000 IN ELECTRICITY COSTS EACH YEAR TOLEDO, OHIO , MARCH 2, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- IN A RESIDENTIAL NEIGHBORHOOD ALONG CRICKET LANE IN PERRYSBURG, FIRSTENERGY ELECTRIC COMPANY (NYSE: FE) TOLEDO EDISON HAS INSTALLED THE FIRST OF ABOUT 1,000 LED STREETLIGHT FIXTURES TO KICK OFF THE CITY OF PERRYSBURG'S $251,000 STREETLIGHT CONVERSION PROJECT.\xa0 THE NEW LEDS ARE ABOUT 50% MORE EFFICIENT THAN THE PREVIOUS HIGH-PRESSURE SODIUM LIGHTS AND ARE EXPECTED TO SAVE THE CITY AN ESTIMATED $30,000 IN ENERGY COSTS ANNUALLY."}